# Beginnings (ahtUrhgan 21, BLU AF1): a level 40 Blue Mage with 5000 gil, Immortal Sentries completed, An Empty Vessel
# completed (completeEvent 0: a GM's completion leaves no var). Waoud (no script; default 61) also answers for An Empty
# Vessel's completed section (78 (gil), an Event: Beginnings' Progress replies beat it). Available: a trade to Waoud: no
# handler: nothing; Waoud 705, option 0: nothing; 705, option 1: begun. Accepted: Waoud 706 (5000) without the brands,
# option 0: nothing; option 1: 1000 gil (PAY_DIVINATION). The five staging NPCs, each with its own script (the Assault
# armband, else 7 / 4; Waudeen 6 / 3): Meyaada 10 (the Brand of the Springserpent); the brand taken by a GM: 10 again
# (Progress beats her script's turn); then 11 (importantEvent: Progress the first time in the zone), 11 again (now
# Event, UseFallback 0: the quest's turn), then her script's turn: 4 (a fresh char's ToAU mission is not at or past
# PRESIDENT_SALAHEEM). The same at Daswil 8 (the Skyserpent), 9, 9, his 4; Nahshib 10 (the Galeserpent), 11, 11, his 4;
# Nareema 12 (the Stoneserpent), 13, 13, her 4; Waudeen 10 (the Flameserpent), 11, 11, his 3.
# Waoud with the five: 707: completed (the Immortal's Scimitar, Branded by the Five Serpents), Omens' mustZone, Omens'
# Timer = now + 60 (1800000060). Completed: no Beginnings section, Omens not available (level 40 < 50): An Empty
# Vessel's 78.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Waoud/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/707 ArrapagoReef/Meyaada/onTrigger CaedarvaMire/onEventFinish/10 MountZhayolm/Waudeen/onTrigger
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=67.116,-6,-78.222 job=BLU lvl=40 gil=5000
mission Toau ImmortalSentries completed
quest AhtUrhgan.AnEmptyVessel completed
