trigger Meyaada                         # 11, importantEvent: Progress the first time
finish
trigger Meyaada                         # 11 again: Event priority, UseFallback 0: the quest's turn
finish
trigger Meyaada                         # the script's turn: 4 (no ToAU mission at or past President Salaheem)
finish-if-event
